                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#1E3A5F",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " Beauty carries 2.1 weeks of cover, against about 5 everywhere else, and is out of stock 6.4 days a month (other categories: under 1).",
